rt, so Rina proposes they all take turns to explain what they want to do, but they still can't seem to agree.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/BySt6OXHEEcKGxnuaIJ8uhgUiN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/BySt6OXHEEcKGxnuaIJ8uhgUiN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/103511/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"3630874","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Karin meets Misato Kawamoto, Ai's neighbor. Ai invites Karin to go together with them. Meanwhile, the student council decides to merge the School Idol Festival with the Culture Festival, with Shioriko managing both events.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bR93zS2OwoN42Nz3VMYZTbc4X7O.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bR93zS2OwoN42Nz3VMYZTbc4X7O.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/103511/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"3630875","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shioriko arranges a pre-show produced by the drama club for the day before the cultural fair. Later, Shizuku tells Yu that she wants to create a unit and perform with Ayumu and Setsuna at the Fair. The next morning, Ayumu and Setsuna follows Yu and Shizuku after finding them together.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fgKTdjE91FqQbpxSLsa9GrYcDkL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fgKTdjE91FqQbpxSLsa9GrYcDkL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/103511/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"3630876","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Setsuna hesitates revealing her identity as Nana Nakagawa, as she thinks her personas should be kept separate. Meanwhile, Kaoruko Mifune, a new music course teacher, praises Yu about the combined event.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xyTJkFYbtlwsoWgTqOv8l6oT1LG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xyTJkFYbtlwsoWgTqOv8l6oT1LG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/103511/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"3630877","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Joint Festival begins. During their time at Shion Academy, the club learns of Kaoruko's past as a school idol, and how Shioriko, her younger sister, looked up to her, hoping to be a school idol herself.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t3CZDcx8Dw5e5MtB4h2dT8LcWGR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t3CZDcx8Dw5e5MtB4h2dT8LcWGR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/103511/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"3630878","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The final day of the 2nd School Idol Festival has arrived. Today, the festival is happening along with Nijigasaki's cultural fair. But Yu still hasn't finished writing the song for the School Idol Club because she wants to make it the best song possible.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wol7Z1v8ZhNsE8s9UJN0B9Ckyz9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wol7Z1v8ZhNsE8s9UJN0B9Ckyz9.jpg","